### Page 1 of 24

```text
CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
1 to Contract #7500
Project:

Purchase & Sale Agreement
Contractor:

V & M Properties LLC
Date Prepared:

5-13-2022

The above referenced contract is hereby modified in the manner set forth in the following and such
amendments and modifications are agreed to by the undersigned, being parties to this contract and
agreement.  All other aspects of the agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

Description of Changes:

This modification removes portions of the agreement that are not applicable to the sale of real property
as described in Contract #7500 Purchase and Sale Agreement between The City of Cheyenne and V &
M Properties, LLC.

Delete Paragraph 3 in its entirety:  “3.  Payment of Taxes.  Prior to closing, the seller shall pay,
when due and payable, all property taxes and assessments asserted against the Real Property for the
current year and for all prior years.  All such taxes for the current year shall be apportioned between
the Parties on a pro rata basis as of the date of closing.”

Delete Paragraph 4b iv in its entirety:  “iv.  All mortgages, notes, and loan documents for any
mortgage which encumbers the Real Property on the date hereof, which mortgages, notes, and loan
documents shall be discharged by the Seller prior to closing; and”

Delete Paragraph 6a vii in its entirety:  “vii.  There are no parties in possession of any portion
of the Real Property, whether as lessees, tenants in sufferance, trespassers, or otherwise.”

Delete Paragraph 10b iv in its entirety:  “iv.  An affidavit of exclusive possession;”

FOR THE BUYER/CITY

__________________________________________
__________________________
Patrick Collins, Mayor

Date

(SEAL)

Attest:

__________________________________________
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk

FOR THE SELLER

__________________________________________

__________________________
V & M Properties, LLC

Date
Victor Bonogofsky
By Stefanie Boster at 8:47 am, May 18, 2022
